== 4.5b start validity: three candidate rules on the same starts (spec uses pd_ok) ==
start                                                         objective | is.finite(F)   F < 1e9 (old script) pd_ok   
negative variances (vm = vy = -0.5)                               1e+10 | TRUE           FALSE              FALSE   
tiny positive variances (vm = vy = 1e-9), positive definite     2.19e+09 | TRUE           FALSE              TRUE    
ordinary start                                                   0.0115 | TRUE           TRUE               TRUE    
is.finite(F) admits the negative-variance start (the sentinel 1e10 is finite); F < 1e9 rejects a genuinely positive-definite start whose objective is large; pd_ok decides both correctly.

