== 4.5c acceptance rule, unit level (stubbed solver results) ==
converged (status 3, resid 1e-9, KKT 1e-8)                                         -> accept
xtol-terminated, still converged (status 4, KKT 2.8e-5)                            -> accept
max evaluations (status 5), feasible, stationary                                   -> REJECT by status
roundoff-limited stall (status -4, resid 0, KKT 1.0): the real stalled start       -> REJECT by status + KKT
stall mislabeled as success (status 4, resid 0, KKT 1.0): only KKT can catch it    -> REJECT by KKT
success but infeasible (status 3, resid 1e-3, KKT 1e-9)                            -> REJECT by residual
